          <p>
            Three patterns stand out. First, the dairy bars cluster tightly: Quest, Kirkland, Barebells, Pure Protein and ONE all deliver 20 or 21 g for 180 to 220 calories. The differences between them are in the sweetener, the fiber and the price, not the headline protein. If you are choosing between those five, choose on how your stomach handles maltitol and on what you pay per box.
