          <p>
            Second, RXBAR is in a different category. Twelve grams of protein for about 200 calories is roughly half the protein density of the dairy bars. That is the price of a short ingredient list built on dates and nuts. It is a perfectly good snack, but it is not an efficient way to add protein, and buying it as a protein bar mostly means paying for almonds and fruit.
