            Third, BUILT Puff looks best on paper, with the most protein per calorie in the table, but part of that protein is collagen. When you discount the collagen share, its useful protein per calorie drops toward the middle of the pack. That is a recurring theme in bars: the leanest-looking labels are often the ones using the cheapest, least complete protein to hit their number.
